#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:45
msgid "Check the existence of a path in a binary cache:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:47
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix path-info --recursive /nix/store/blzxgyvrk32ki6xga10phr4sby2xf25q-"
"geeqie-1.5.1 --store https://cache.nixos.org/\n"
"path '/nix/store/blzxgyvrk32ki6xga10phr4sby2xf25q-geeqie-1.5.1' is not "
"valid\n"
"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:53
msgid ""
"Print the 10 most recently added paths (using --json and the jq(1) command):"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:60
msgid "Show the size of the entire Nix store:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:67
msgid ""
"Show every path whose closure is bigger than 1 GB, sorted by closure size:"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:70
msgid ""
"```console\n"
"# nix path-info --json --all --closure-size \\\n"
"  | jq 'map_values(.closureSize | select(. < 1e9)) | to_entries | sort_by(."
"value)'\n"
"[\n"
"  …,\n"
"  {\n"
"    .key = \"/nix/store/zqamz3cz4dbzfihki2mk7a63mbkxz9xq-nixos-system-"
"machine-20.09.20201112.3090c65\",\n"
"    .value = 5887562256,\n"
"  }\n"
"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-path-info.md:82
